  "question": {
    "text": "<p>How many time faster than the present speed would the earth have to rotate about its axis so that the apparent weight of the bodies on the equator becomes zero? (The radius of the earth&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.4</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>)</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
